post.description:
A2A v1.0 streaming variant: emits SSE phases, chunks, and final task.

Idempotency-Key is not applied to streams; after a dropped connection,
recover the result with GET /a2a/v1/tasks/{task_id} from task_created.

The wire format is a sequence of named SSE events:

  event: task_created   data: {task_id, agent_id, state, created_at}
  event: phase          data: {name, elapsed_ms, ...payload}
  event: chunk          data: {text, elapsed_ms}
  event: heartbeat      data: {elapsed_ms}
  event: task_completed data: {task, artifacts, metadata}
  event: task_failed    data: {error, task_id}
  data: [DONE]

Phases come from CitadelEngine.process_query_stream and match the names
surfaced on /api/query/stream (retrieval_start, retrieval_complete,
arena_start, arena_complete, synthesis_start, etc.).
